  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women-led Multi-stakeholder Partnership Green Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;SO: Improve access to decent jobs and entrepreneurship opportunities in the green economy and the circular economy for women in all their diversity .&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OP 1: Strengthened technical, operational, and networking capacities of gender-responsive and environmentally sensitive NSAs to implement initiatives in the field of climate change adaptation and mitigation, disaster risk reduction, environmental protection, sustainable agriculture, sustainable forestry, responsible consumption and production practices, and gender equality. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OP2: Increased public and private sector financing mechanisms for MSMEs, owned or managed by women, including women&#xbf;s informal business gender bonds.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
